      "description": "Throughput of successful uploads per cache. After a miss the client reads the chunk from Blob Storage and uploads it here, so this approximates bytes fetched from Blob on behalf of the cache; it also includes direct cache writes. DACS does not export Blob traffic itself.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
